# Fetichism (Bastok 1-3): the sections that do not apply. Main, a level 10 Warrior of San d'Orian holding the four
# Quadav Fetich parts and no mission: Cleades: section 1 fails (not Bastok): his script's 1003; the four parts traded:
# no section 2: no event. bob, a level 10 Warrior of Bastok with A Geological Survey current (a GM): Cleades: 1-3's
# sections fail (a current mission, not 1-3): 1-2's own section answers (ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 3); the four parts
# traded: no event. Rival zone-ins, another mission's script: both chars' logins in Bastok Markets play Seekers of
# Adventure's Rumors from the West onZoneIn, which returns 22 each (no event packet; bob's login also writes his area 12
# status 2).
lists BastokMarkets/Cleades/onTrigger BastokMarkets/Cleades/onTrade
char zone=BastokMarkets pos=-358,-10,-168 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=0
char bob zone=BastokMarkets pos=-358,-10,-168 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
bob: mission Rov Resonance current
bob: mission Bastok GeologicalSurvey current
item QuadavFetichHead
item QuadavFetichTorso
item QuadavFetichArms
item QuadavFetichLegs
bob: item QuadavFetichHead
bob: item QuadavFetichTorso
bob: item QuadavFetichArms
bob: item QuadavFetichLegs
login
trigger Cleades                         # not Bastok: no section: his script's 1003
finish
walk -357,-10,-168
trade Cleades QuadavFetichHead x1 QuadavFetichTorso x1 QuadavFetichArms x1 QuadavFetichLegs x1   # no section 2: no event
bob: login
bob: trigger Cleades                    # a current mission (1-2): 1-2's ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 3
bob: walk -357,-10,-168
bob: trade Cleades QuadavFetichHead x1 QuadavFetichTorso x1 QuadavFetichArms x1 QuadavFetichLegs x1   # no event
